Title: XYORAS Access
Summary: Accessibility for Pokemon Gen 6
Description: Speaks dialogue, menus, battles, and the map aloud for blind and low-vision players. Pokemon X, Y, Omega Ruby, and Alpha Sapphire.
Compatibility: Any

# Heap reserved for the plugin. eSpeak NG's voice data and synthesis buffers
# dominate this; see "AI docks/05-plugin-architecture.md" for the budget.
# Measure real usage before lowering it.
MemorySize: 12MiB
